  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek Sekizlisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\nGelecekle
    ilgili birtak\u0131m kararlar alabilmen i\xE7in, hayat\u0131ndaki baz\u0131 konular\u0131n
    neticeye varmas\u0131 gerekiyormu\u015F. Senin i\xE7in belirsizli\u011Fin, k\xF6t\xFC
    sonu\xE7lara ula\u015Fmaktan daha k\xF6t\xFC oldu\u011Fu bir d\xF6nem ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015F
    ve nihayet ard\u0131nda b\u0131rakm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n {{isim}}. Neyin nas\u0131l
    sonu\xE7land\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilemiyorum; ancak bu kart sende pek \xE7ok
    de\u011Fi\u015Fime neden oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Belki imkanlar\u0131n,
    belki ruh halin, belki sa\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n, belki de fiziksel \xF6zelliklerin
    de\u011Fi\u015Fti. De\u011Fi\u015Fen her ne ise, sende h\u0131zl\u0131 geli\u015Fmeler
    yaratt\u0131\u011F\u0131 \xE7ok a\xE7\u0131k."
